# Insecure cookie (CWE-614): res.cookie set without secure:true.

test "js: cookie with no options is insecure"
  lang javascript
  expect VYQL-CFG-007
  code
  ```
  function h(req, res) { res.cookie("n", "v"); }
  ```

test "js: cookie httpOnly-only (secure omitted) is insecure"
  lang javascript
  expect VYQL-CFG-007
  code
  ```
  function h(req, res) { res.cookie("n", "v", { httpOnly: true }); }
  ```

test "js: cookie with secure:true is safe"
  lang javascript
  reject VYQL-CFG-007
  code
  ```
  function h(req, res) { res.cookie("n", "v", { httpOnly: true, secure: true }); }
  ```
